<title>UK: SOCCER-EUROPEAN CUP AND CUP WINNERS' CUP RESULTS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-EUROPEAN CUP AND CUP WINNERS' CUP RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of preliminary round,</p>
<p>first leg matches in European club competitions on Wednesday:</p>
<p>European Cup</p>
<p>In Gothenburg:</p>
<p>IFK Gothenburg (Sweden)  3  Rangers (Scotland)  0</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Gothenburg - Stefan Pettersson 55, Per Karlsson 58, Peter</p>
<p>Eriksson 89.</p>
<p>    HT: 0-0.    Att: 23,000</p>
<p>In Salzburg, Austria:</p>
<p>SV Salzburg (Austria) 0 Sparta Prague (Czech Republic) 0</p>
<p>Red card: Andrzej Lesiak (SV Salzburg) 82</p>
<p>Att: 8,000</p>
<p>In Jerusalem:</p>
<p>Betar Jerusalem (Israel) 0 Sporting Lisbon (Portugal) 0</p>
<p>Att: 12,000</p>
